[{"answer":"Many of my friends have dyed their hair different colors.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/1.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't mean normal hair colors like brown or black.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/2.mp3"},{"answer":"My friends have dyed their hair orange, purple and blue.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/3.mp3"},{"answer":"I told my mother that I would like to dye my hair green.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/4.mp3"},{"answer":"I explained to my mother that I would only use food coloring.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/5.mp3"},{"answer":"The green would not last forever.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/6.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother said that dyeing your hair was a silly fad.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/7.mp3"},{"answer":"She said that I would not look good with green hair.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I said that if I couldn't dye my hair green, maybe I could get a nose ring.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/9.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother said \"no\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/10.mp3"},{"answer":"I said that maybe a tattoo on my arm would be nice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/11.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother said \"no way\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/12.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother said that she did some crazy things when she was a young girl.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/13.mp3"},{"answer":"She said that she used to iron her hair to make it straight.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/14.mp3"},{"answer":"That sounds quite boring to me.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/15.mp3"},{"answer":"My friend Joan came over.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Her hair is dyed bright pink.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/17.mp3"},{"answer":"My father said \"nice hair, Joan\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I don't think that he really meant it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/19.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother says that when I am an adult","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/20.mp3"},{"answer":"I can dye my hair whatever crazy color I like,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/21.mp3"},{"answer":"but for now she would like me to leave my hair its natural color.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I tried to tell her that all my friends were doing it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/23.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother asked, \"if all your friends were jumping off a cliff, would you do it too?\"","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I said \"no\".","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I think I'll have to wait to have green hair, but maybe by the time I'm old enough to dye my hair green,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/26.mp3"},{"answer":"I won't want it that color.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/27.mp3"},{"answer":"My mother says that fads change all the time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/28.mp3"},{"answer":"One day something might be popular, and the next day it's not in style at all.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/29.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll just have to live without green hair for now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I wonder what the fad will be next month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/general-english/102-i-want-to-dye-my-hair-green-2019-04-07-03-54-42/31.mp3"}]
